 calculator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record here runs 75 years, from 1951 to 2025. On the middle of the county&rsquo;s grids, January to February and September to October each came in under 90% of normal in 37 of those years. In 2025, August to September on the middle of the grids came in at 43% of normal. Grid 23248 had its driest year in 1956, at 52% of normal.</p>"}
